uthern India.</article-title><source>Int J Dermatol</source> <year>2007</year>;<volume>46</volume>:<fpage>55</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>8</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-4632.2006.03043.x</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17214721</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R5"><label>5. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Rao</surname> <given-names>GR</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Padmaja</surname> <given-names>J</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Lalitha</surname> <given-names>MK</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Rao</surname> <given-names>PV</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Gopal</surname> <given-names>KV</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Kumar</surname> <given-names>HK</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>An outbreak of cutaneous anthrax in a non-endemic district&#x02014;Visakhapatnam in Andhra Pradesh.</article-title><source>Indian J Dermatol Venereol Leprol</source> <year>2005</year>;<volume>71</volume>:<fpage>102</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16394383</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R6"><label>6. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Sekhar</surname> <given-names>PC</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Singh</surname> <given-names>RS</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Sridhar</surname> <given-names>MS</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Bhaskar</surname> <given-names>CJ</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Rao</surname> <given-names>YS</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Outbreak of human anthrax in Ramabhadrapuram Village of Chittor District of Andhara Pradesh.</article-title><source>Indian J Med Res</source> <year>1990</year>;<volume>91</volume>:<fpage>448</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>52</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2091991</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R7"><label>7. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Thappa</surname> <given-names>DM</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Karthikeyan</surname> <given-names>K</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Anthrax: an overview within the Indian subcontinent.</article-title><source>Int J Dermatol</source> <year>2001</year>;<volume>40</volume>:<fpage>216</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>22</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1365-4362.2001.01174.x</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11422531</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>